    }
    

Compliant Solution
    
    
    private static final String ACTION_1 = "action1";  // Compliant
    
    public void run() {
      prepare(ACTION_1);                               // Compliant
      execute(ACTION_1);
      release(ACTION_1);
    }
    

Exceptions

To prevent generating some false-positives, literals having less than 5 characters are excluded.

 

